Play: Golden Canonical
Description: Formatter fixture.
Var: USER = 'alice'

Act: Login(user = 'alice')
Tags: smoke, auth
Platforms: web, android
    Examples:
        | user  | password |
        |-------|----------|
        | alice | secret   |
        | bob   | hunter2  |
    Perform: Login(user = '${example.user}', password = '${example.password}')
    Perform: Auth.Verify
